<title>SPAIN: TABLE - Spanish 6-mo, 5-yr yields rise at auction.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Spanish 6-mo, 5-yr yields rise at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated</p>
<p>  6-mo   5.051  4.988   97.510   97.54   191.89   143.16</p>
<p> 5-year  5.668  5.653   95.300  111.35   519.51   215.18</p>
<p>15-year  6.687  6.852   91.700  119.30   116.03    43.58</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
